<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher, compared to Tuesday. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>US 3-4	290-310 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows:  2.00 lower. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-700 lbs    48.50</p>
</text>
